  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCP - Access to Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will&#xa0;improve Pacific Island Countries (PICs) capability and capacity to&#xa0;better access and use climate finance by supporting the Pacific Community (SPC) and the Secretariat of the Pacific Regional Environment Programme (SPREP), to enhance the support they provide to PICs as regional Direct Access Entities to the Green Climate Fund, and other climate funds. This Activity also provides direct support to the Cooks Islands to support access to finance and climate priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
